{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/playwright/mcp","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:16.247Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/playwright/mcp/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/playwright/mcp/about"},"readme":"## About\n\n[Playwright MCP](https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp) is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that provides browser automation capabilities using Playwright. This server enables LLMs to interact with web pages through structured accessibility snapshots, bypassing the need for screenshots or visually-tuned models.\n\nRead more in [Playwright MCP](https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp).\n\n## Usage\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"playwright\": {\n      \"command\": \"docker\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"run\",\n        \"-i\",\n        \"--rm\",\n        \"--init\",\n        \"mcr.microsoft.com/playwright/mcp\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Support\n\n[File an issue](https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/issues)\n\n## License\n\nThe Playwright project itself is licensed under the Apache 2.0 license, see [here](https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp/blob/main/LICENSE). For more information visit the: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice).","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-18T23:42:37.1403867+00:00","categories":["MCP"],"keywords":[],"license":"Apache-2.0","links":[{"name":"licence","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp/blob/main/LICENSE"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"730K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:77dccc5ce9e94cb8ae7ebea87ddbb6cd54b05760c4d63c54e16accf2726b8734","pushed":"2026-09-18T23:42:37.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],